# Differences from exps/OM4.single_column.COBALT (the regression case):
#   * ERA5 forcing (hourly, padded): INPUT/ERA5_<var>.nc are links that run.sh
#     points at the year being simulated. Scale factors as in 202611_nocbed.
#   * Atmospheric deposition of Fe, lithogenic dust and N is ENABLED from
